      message: "G\u1EEDi y\xEAu c\u1EA7u r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng! Admin s\u1EBD duy\u1EC7t v\xE0 gi\u1EA3i ng\xE2n s\u1EDBm.",
